{"composability_scorecard": {"html": "<div id=\"viva_ComposabilityScorecard\" style=\"width:100%;height:420px\"></div><script src=\"https://cdn.plot.ly/plotly-2.27.0.min.js\"></script><script>Plotly.newPlot(\"viva_ComposabilityScorecard\",[{\"type\": \"heatmap\", \"x\": [\"Monolithic<br>Tellurium\", \"Operator<br>split\", \"Modular<br>submodels\", \"Native<br>process-bigraph\", \"Ensemble<br>(Ray)\", \"Coupling<br>demo\"], \"y\": [\"substitutability\", \"coupling readiness\", \"multiscale fit\"], \"z\": [[0, 1, 2, 2, 2, 3], [0, 1, 2, 2, 2, 3], [0, 1, 2, 3, 2, 3]], \"zmin\": 0, \"zmax\": 3, \"colorscale\": \"Viridis\", \"text\": [[0, 1, 2, 2, 2, 3], [0, 1, 2, 2, 2, 3], [0, 1, 2, 3, 2, 3]], \"texttemplate\": \"%{text}\", \"textfont\": {\"size\": 16, \"color\": \"white\"}, \"xgap\": 3, \"ygap\": 3, \"colorbar\": {\"title\": {\"text\": \"score (0-3)\"}, \"tickvals\": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, \"customdata\": [[\"arm1\", \"arm2\", \"arm3\", \"arm4\", \"arm5\", \"arm6\"], [\"arm1\", \"arm2\", \"arm3\", \"arm4\", \"arm5\", \"arm6\"], [\"arm1\", \"arm2\", \"arm3\", \"arm4\", \"arm5\", \"arm6\"]], \"hovertemplate\": \"%{customdata}<br>%{y}: %{z}/3<extra></extra>\"}],{\"title\": {\"text\": \"Composability scorecard<br><span style='font-size:12px;color:#64748b'>0 = none, 3 = full; rises from the monolith to the cross-engine coupling demo</span>\", \"x\": 0.02, \"xanchor\": \"left\", \"font\": {\"size\": 17}}, \"margin\": {\"l\": 140, \"r\": 25, \"t\": 80, \"b\": 80}, \"plot_bgcolor\": \"rgba(0,0,0,0)\", \"paper_bgcolor\": \"rgba(0,0,0,0)\", \"font\": {\"color\": \"#64748b\"}, \"xaxis\": {\"side\": \"bottom\"}, \"yaxis\": {\"autorange\": \"reversed\"}}, {responsive:true, displayModeBar:false});</script>"}, "tradeoff_map": {"html": "<div id=\"viva_TradeoffMap\" style=\"width:100%;height:420px\"></div><script src=\"https://cdn.plot.ly/plotly-2.27.0.min.js\"></script><script>Plotly.newPlot(\"viva_TradeoffMap\",[{\"type\": \"scatter\", \"mode\": \"markers+text\", \"name\": \"accuracy-scored arms\", \"x\": [1e-09, 0.06742701571682175, 0.1, 1.0648853847474125e-07], \"y\": [0.31991688028186943, 0.0801598025192886, 0.05, 0.02021926202894537], \"text\": [\"arm1\", \"arm2\", \"arm3\", \"arm4\"], \"textposition\": \"top center\", \"customdata\": [[\"arm1\", \"Monolithic Tellurium\", 0.0, 0.31991688028186943, 0], [\"arm2\", \"Operator split\", 0.06742701571682175, 0.0801598025192886, 3], [\"arm3\", \"Modular submodels\", 0.1, 0.05, 6], [\"arm4\", \"Native process-bigraph\", 1.0648853847474125e-07, 0.02021926202894537, 7]], \"marker\": {\"size\": [14, 41, 68, 77], \"color\": [0, 3, 6, 7], \"cmin\": 0, \"cmax\": 9, \"colorscale\": \"Viridis\", \"colorbar\": {\"title\": {\"text\": \"composability<br>(sum, 0-9)\"}, \"x\": 0.72, \"len\": 0.8}, \"line\": {\"width\": 1.5, \"color\": \"#64748b\"}}, \"hovertemplate\": \"<b>%{customdata[0]}</b> %{customdata[1]}<br>max rel err: %{customdata[2]:.3g}<br>framework share: %{customdata[3]:.1%}<br>composability: %{customdata[4]}/9<extra></extra>\"}, {\"type\": \"scatter\", \"mode\": \"markers\", \"name\": \"arm5 (off accuracy axis)\", \"x\": [0.5], \"y\": [0.85], \"xaxis\": \"x2\", \"yaxis\": \"y2\", \"marker\": {\"symbol\": \"star\", \"size\": 41.0, \"color\": 6, \"cmin\": 0, \"cmax\": 9, \"colorscale\": \"Viridis\", \"line\": {\"width\": 1.5, \"color\": \"#64748b\"}}, \"hovertemplate\": \"<b>arm5</b> (Ensemble (Ray)): cross-instance ensemble: scales via Ray (7.5x), accuracy-exempt \\u2014 no accuracy axis<br>composability 6/9<extra></extra>\", \"showlegend\": false}, {\"type\": \"scatter\", \"mode\": \"markers\", \"name\": \"arm6 (off accuracy axis)\", \"x\": [0.5], \"y\": [0.57], \"xaxis\": \"x2\", \"yaxis\": \"y2\", \"marker\": {\"symbol\": \"star\", \"size\": 54.5, \"color\": 9, \"cmin\": 0, \"cmax\": 9, \"colorscale\": \"Viridis\", \"line\": {\"width\": 1.5, \"color\": \"#64748b\"}}, \"hovertemplate\": \"<b>arm6</b> (Coupling demo): cross-engine composition \\u2014 no accuracy axis<br>composability 9/9, framework share 1.3%<extra></extra>\", \"showlegend\": false}],{\"title\": {\"text\": \"Speed x accuracy x composability<br><span style='font-size:12px;color:#64748b'>each decomposition trades framework share and error for composability</span>\", \"x\": 0.02, \"xanchor\": \"left\", \"font\": {\"size\": 17}}, \"margin\": {\"l\": 70, \"r\": 25, \"t\": 80, \"b\": 100}, \"plot_bgcolor\": \"rgba(0,0,0,0)\", \"paper_bgcolor\": \"rgba(0,0,0,0)\", \"font\": {\"color\": \"#64748b\"}, \"xaxis\": {\"title\": {\"text\": \"max relative error vs reference (log)\"}, \"gridcolor\": \"rgba(148,163,184,0.22)\", \"zeroline\": false, \"type\": \"log\", \"range\": [-9.5, 0], \"domain\": [0, 0.66]}, \"yaxis\": {\"title\": {\"text\": \"framework overhead share\"}, \"gridcolor\": \"rgba(148,163,184,0.22)\", \"zeroline\": false, \"tickformat\": \".0%\", \"rangemode\": \"tozero\"}, \"xaxis2\": {\"domain\": [0.76, 1], \"range\": [0, 1], \"visible\": false}, \"yaxis2\": {\"range\": [0, 1], \"visible\": false, \"anchor\": \"x2\"}, \"showlegend\": false, \"annotations\": [{\"xref\": \"paper\", \"yref\": \"paper\", \"x\": 0.0, \"y\": -0.2, \"xanchor\": \"left\", \"showarrow\": false, \"font\": {\"size\": 11}, \"text\": \"arm1 error is exactly 0, drawn at the 1e-9 floor. Lower-left is faster-share and more accurate; bigger/brighter is more composable.\"}, {\"xref\": \"x2\", \"yref\": \"y2\", \"x\": 0.5, \"y\": 0.85, \"yshift\": -22, \"showarrow\": false, \"align\": \"center\", \"text\": \"<b>arm5</b> (Ensemble (Ray)): cross-instance ensemble: scales via Ray (7.5x), accuracy-exempt \\u2014 no accuracy axis<br>composability 6/9\", \"font\": {\"size\": 11}}, {\"xref\": \"x2\", \"yref\": \"y2\", \"x\": 0.5, \"y\": 0.57, \"yshift\": -22, \"showarrow\": false, \"align\": \"center\", \"text\": \"<b>arm6</b> (Coupling demo): cross-engine composition \\u2014 no accuracy axis<br>composability 9/9, framework share 1.3%\", \"font\": {\"size\": 11}}]}, {responsive:true, displayModeBar:false});</script>"}, "decision_table": {"html": "<div id=\"viva_DecisionTable\" style=\"width:100%;height:560px\"></div><script src=\"https://cdn.plot.ly/plotly-2.27.0.min.js\"></script><script>Plotly.newPlot(\"viva_DecisionTable\",[{\"type\": \"table\", \"columnwidth\": [1.3, 1.6, 1.3, 0.9, 5], \"header\": {\"values\": [\"<b>Arm</b>\", \"<b>Speed (overhead / ratio)</b>\", \"<b>Accuracy</b>\", \"<b>Composability</b>\", \"<b>Use / Avoid / Why</b>\"], \"align\": \"left\", \"fill\": {\"color\": \"#334155\"}, \"font\": {\"color\": \"white\", \"size\": 13}}, \"cells\": {\"values\": [[\"arm1: Monolithic Tellurium\", \"arm2: Operator split\", \"arm3: Modular submodels\", \"arm4: Native process-bigraph\", \"arm5: Ensemble (Ray)\", \"arm6: Coupling demo\"], [\"32.0% framework, 0.07 s\", \"8.0% framework, 0.88 s\", \"5.0% framework\", \"2.0% framework, 0.30 s\", \"7.52x parallel (1.19 s to 0.16 s)\", \"1.3% framework, 30.17 s\"], [\"exact (reference)\", \"0.067 max rel err\", \"0.1 max rel err\", \"1.1e-07 max rel err\", \"N/A (accuracy-exempt)\", \"N/A (accuracy-exempt)\"], [\"0/9\", \"3/9\", \"6/9\", \"7/9\", \"6/9\", \"9/9\"], [\"USE as the reference and when you only need one fast, exact model. AVOID when parts must be swapped or coupled: nothing is substitutable.\", \"USE for a first decomposition with equal coupling intervals. AVOID coarse intervals: error is 0.067 and falls only as the interval shrinks.\", \"USE when submodels must be swappable. AVOID mismatched intervals: O(P^2) multi-rate scheduler cost in pb<=1.10.x; PR #270 (unmerged 2026-10-25) -> O(P log P). Prefer equal coupling intervals.\", \"USE as the default composable build. Scalar vs array: indistinguishable at 17 species; scalar-dict tax is linear in element count, bites only at 100s-1000s.\", \"USE for many independent instances: Ray gives 7.5x on 16 cores. AVOID threads: libroadrunner does not release the GIL; ThreadPool(8)=0.99x\", \"USE to couple across engines (capability, no accuracy axis). Highest composability; cost is wall-clock.\"]], \"align\": \"left\", \"height\": 44, \"fill\": {\"color\": \"rgba(148,163,184,0.15)\"}, \"font\": {\"size\": 12}}}],{\"title\": {\"text\": \"Decision table: which arm when<br><span style='font-size:12px;color:#64748b'>speed x accuracy x composability (arm1/2/4/6 measured live; arm3/arm5 from their studies)</span>\", \"x\": 0.02, \"xanchor\": \"left\", \"font\": {\"size\": 17}}, \"margin\": {\"l\": 20, \"r\": 20, \"t\": 80, \"b\": 20}, \"plot_bgcolor\": \"rgba(0,0,0,0)\", \"paper_bgcolor\": \"rgba(0,0,0,0)\", \"font\": {\"color\": \"#64748b\"}, \"height\": 560}, {responsive:true, displayModeBar:false});</script>"}}